I wrote two task files and an issue-responses file in session_plan/. The commit step didn't happen: session_plan/ is gitignored, so git add refused it. The files are only on disk, which should be fine if the harness reads them from there.

Task 1: build, project #1250 (milestone 3, the model half). An agent file's model: field gets honoured.
• Order: the agent file's model comes first, then sub_agent_model, then the main model. This follows Claude Code's documented order, minus its per-call parameter.
• `inherit`: means the main model.
• Aliases `haiku`/`sonnet`/`opus`: under anthropic, an alias in the same family as the main model runs on the main model's exact id. Any other alias resolves to an id taken from yoagent's presets, not one typed from memory.
• Other providers: a Claude alias or a claude-… id is never sent to them. It falls back, and a note names both the requested model and the one used.
• Other explicit ids: sent as written, so ollama and custom ids keep working.
• One authority: a single resolver drives both the dispatch and the yoyo agents row, so they can't disagree.
• Disclaimer: the "not honoured yet" text is removed from all five places it appears, and a test named after it guards the change.

Task 2: fix, #1147, outside the agent subsystem. The agent code took 6 of the last 8 changes, so this slot goes elsewhere. The task checks each xai id yoyo offers against xAI's own docs. grok-3 is retired (May 15, 2026, per xAI's retirement page) but is still offered; grok-3-mini, grok-4 and grok-4-mini haven't been checked yet. Retired ids get dropped and added to the existing list of ids no vendor serves, and the test is run red first. The findings table goes on #1147 before any edit.

Done with `gh` while planning:
• #1255: I commented to add a second problem to its done-when. Without --trust-project, a project agent is refused with no notice, and the model quietly used explore_agent instead, so the user got a different agent from the one they asked for.
• #1206 and #1208: no new work. In both, the remaining part waits on yoagent.

